# Split from server.lang - dialogue bundle (aetherhaven_dialogue_farmer)
# Full translation keys are aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.<lineKey> (see Hytale I18nModule).
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_abandoned.body=All right. If you still want a farm here, just say so when you're ready.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_abandoned.c0=Will do.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_abandoned.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_accepted.body=I'll stay at the inn until the farm plot is ready. Then find me after. We've got work to do.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_accepted.c0=See you there.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_accepted.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_building.body=When the plot is built, I'll head over to the farming bench to set up. Come find me there, and we'll call it done once everything's in place.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_building.c0=I need to drop the quest.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_building.c1=I will keep going.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_building.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_done.body=Good lighting, great soil, perfect place for fresh vegetables. I'll get to work right away.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_done.c0=Grow well.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_done.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_accepted.body=When the house is done, register me on the bookshelf, then find me. I want to end this standing on my own floorboards, not borrowed ones.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_accepted.c0=Count on it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_accepted.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_finish.body=Now I, too, have a place to take root. Thank you!
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_finish.c0=Glad to hear it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_finish.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_offer.body=The fields take honest work and I sure am enjoying it, but I could really use a home of my own. Could you stake a plot and get me registered on the bookshelf of a new house of my own?
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_offer.c0=I'll build it.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_offer.c1=Not yet.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_offer.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_remind.body=I am really looking forward to that new house. Remember to register me on the bookshelf and let me know!
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_remind.c0=I'll find you.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_house_remind.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_quest_farm.body=I've spent too many nights counting cracks in Corin's floorboards, dreaming of getting a farm started in town. Stake a farm plot, fence it off, and set the bench. I'll give you what you need to place it. Use your staff, pay the sign, and I'll meet you at the bench when the ground is ready for planting.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_quest_farm.c0=We'll get it built.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_quest_farm.c1=Not right now.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.irienne_quest_farm.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.rep_reward_100.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.rep_reward_25.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.rep_reward_50.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.rep_reward_75.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.body=Irienne Mossmark. Farmer. Or at least I will be if there's room for me to start a farm here. Everyone needs fresh vegetables in their lives.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c0=You wanted to talk about your own place.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c1=Your house is ready. Your name is registered. You can move in when you want.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c2=Your house is still rising.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c3=Good to see the farm feeding everyone.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c4=The farm is ready whenever you are.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c5=About the fields...
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c6=You said you could use a farmer in town.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.c7=See you later.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.root.speaker=Irienne Mossmark
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.love=Well, look at you. This is the kind of help folks remember.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.like=This will do nicely for the next row.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.neutral=Could be worse. Good effort.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.dislike=That's not for soil. Or anyone, really.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.fallback=If you need to chat about crops, the farm build, or what the soil is doing, start here.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.0=Soil under my nails again. That means the day was productive.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.1=Plants don't get angry like people do. There's peace in gardening.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.2=Wind off the field smells like rain, maybe. I'm watching the clouds to be sure.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.3=If you need numbers on yields, give me a minute. I don't guess aloud; the numbers have to be right.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.4=The pump sounded steady this morning. That's the kind of news I like to hear.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.5=Weeds never sleep. Neither do I, but I still answer questions if you ask.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.6=If you brought mud, leave it outside. I keep the seed table clean for the sprouts.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.7=Chickens are loud today. That usually means they're fine, just full of energy.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.8=If you want a straight answer about a crop, point at the row. I know where the trouble is.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.greeting.9=Tell me what broke before you tell me who to blame. Saves us both time.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.love.0=Good seed and clean tools tell me you respect the season.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.love.1=I always notice when someone brings food that actually feeds a crew after a long day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.love.2=If you bring honest fertilizer or solid lumber for repairs, you speak my language.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.love.3=Rain barrels and tight lids matter here. Gifts like that show you pay attention to the details.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.love.4=Healthy starts make me softer than people expect. Bring starts, not speeches.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.dislike.0=I do not want another rock collection from the road unless it's going under a foundation.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.dislike.1=Raw meat on my seed table is a fight waiting to happen. Keep it away from the dirt.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.dislike.2=If it only belongs in a tomb, do not bring it to the barn door.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.dislike.3=Trash scrap and bent nails make poor mulch and worse gifts.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.main_hub.hint.dislike.4=Poison and rot ruin more than mood. I have no patience for either near the feed.

aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.birthday.greeting=It is my birthday today. The fields feel a little brighter already.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.love.birthday=It is my birthday and this gift is wonderful. You made my whole day.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.like.birthday=A birthday gift like this. You have good taste.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.neutral.birthday=Thanks. A simple gift on my birthday still means a lot.
aetherhaven.dialogue.aetherhaven_farmer.gift.dislike.birthday=It is my birthday and you brought that. Well. I still appreciate the thought.
